field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1064156b-f30e-55b2-b6f0-e825bc55e1e0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501382} {:answer/id #uuid "22689487-5be7-57f4-83d8-1de65d9b4694" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6 \\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501384} {:answer/id #uuid "643ef294-255a-50c2-b361-7fb11bf24717" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501393} {:answer/id #uuid "c82c134e-3f2c-5916-9411-d5e7b2847411" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10 \\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501404} {:answer/id #uuid "f609e524-19c0-530c-a969-08f856f8f9e7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10 \\sqrt{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501410}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c82c134e-3f2c-5916-9411-d5e7b2847411" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10 \\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501404} :answer-field/id #uuid "b3672b93-4679-5491-bb12-4ccb62ec0b4e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501400}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "51236f62-ba5d-5c78-8128-0c42c6d77d9b" :question/problem "![](images/56/5682cc802577e4dd43f42e03bfc829658fc96ca83a15422aa079fe2b43258a0c.png)\n\nLet $A(-8, 2)$ and $B(6, 0)$. Find $|\\overrightarrow{AB}|$." :question/requires-calculator false :question/worked-solution "We have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\overrightarrow{OA} &= a = - 8 i + 2 j, \\\\\n\\overrightarrow{OB} &= b = 6 i.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpressing $\\overrightarrow{AB}$ as the difference of position vectors, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\overrightarrow{AB} &= \\overrightarrow{OB} - \\overrightarrow{OA} \\\\\n&= b - a \\\\\n&= (6 i) - (- 8 i + 2 j) \\\\\n&= 14 i - 2 j\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the formula for the magnitude of a vector, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n|\\overrightarrow{AB}| &= \\sqrt{(14)^{2} + (-2)^{2}} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{196 + 4} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{200} \\\\\n&= 10 \\sqrt{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186501391 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4555636f-851f-5e9a-97d4-f0c927f479bc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "20" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501388} {:answer/id #uuid "684fb4dc-3f86-5814-8b54-f899578ebd2d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "24" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501394} {:answer/id #uuid "c1702806-4afa-5e76-baef-2d46830762f1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "20 \\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501403} {:answer/id #uuid "c9fac228-4948-536a-82ec-632379bd0a8d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12 \\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501406} {:answer/id #uuid "f61881ec-1910-5308-9caa-62794e33d7f2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "20 \\sqrt{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501411}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c1702806-4afa-5e76-baef-2d46830762f1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "20 \\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501403} :answer-field/id #uuid "b49bb760-a1d5-54eb-84a1-6966067cef0b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501401}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "5b1e6461-4662-5ed4-8cde-319bf158b165" :question/problem "![](images/57/57fd993fac384d9dd76399aa35eec0d9113afeb3c1d24c0a5349d7b4b99df4f1.png)\n\nLet $A(-16, 4)$ and $B(12, 0)$. Find $|\\overrightarrow{AB}|$." :question/requires-calculator false :question/worked-solution "We have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\overrightarrow{OA} &= a = - 16 i + 4 j, \\\\\n\\overrightarrow{OB} &= b = 12 i.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpressing $\\overrightarrow{AB}$ as the difference of position vectors, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\overrightarrow{AB} &= \\overrightarrow{OB} - \\overrightarrow{OA} \\\\\n&= b - a \\\\\n&= (12 i) - (- 16 i + 4 j) \\\\\n&= 28 i - 4 j\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the formula for the magnitude of a vector, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n|\\overrightarrow{AB}| &= \\sqrt{(28)^{2} + (-4)^{2}} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{784 + 16} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{800} \\\\\n&= 20 \\sqrt{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186501407 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "70508e9b-a14a-5a98-8e92-1e7ad5d853c7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "16" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501396} {:answer/id #uuid "8d049bb8-f5e4-5c04-829f-a53cafde9397" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501398} {:answer/id #uuid "a0451aba-8b5c-5281-ac81-2b22e276ad68" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6 \\sqrt{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501399} {:answer/id #uuid "df4172c0-8628-54c0-81a3-e9013141b07a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2 \\sqrt{26}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501409} {:answer/id #uuid "f95e5d75-a09f-5293-b330-062df6b3f507" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2 \\sqrt{23}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501412}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "df4172c0-8628-54c0-81a3-e9013141b07a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2 \\sqrt{26}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501409} :answer-field/id #uuid "3d4df1b5-ef4c-5db5-95a8-06e66305be52" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501387}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "d8e7cd39-a979-5900-aba6-00ca0310cc42" :question/problem "![](images/d7/d7b3f6503172aeab9c4554ffac492a9aab8c16e9ce14f5c552cd1d89dcaa3c66.png)\n\nLet $P(-4, 4)$ and $Q(6, 6)$. Find $|\\overrightarrow{PQ}|$." :question/requires-calculator false :question/worked-solution "We have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\overrightarrow{OP} &= p = - 4 i + 4 j, \\\\\n\\overrightarrow{OQ} &= q = 6 i + 6 j.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpressing $\\overrightarrow{PQ}$ as the difference of position vectors, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\overrightarrow{PQ} &= \\overrightarrow{OQ} - \\overrightarrow{OP} \\\\\n&= q - p \\\\\n&= (6 i + 6 j) - (- 4 i + 4 j) \\\\\n&= 10 i + 2 j\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the formula for the magnitude of a vector, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n|\\overrightarrow{PQ}| &= \\sqrt{(10)^{2} + (2)^{2}} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{100 + 4} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{104} \\\\\n&= 2 \\sqrt{26}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186501414 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1da9c0a6-14cc-517f-a698-c8a70ee46bb8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9 \\sqrt{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501383} {:answer/id #uuid "45e58fef-c1c7-52df-807b-c1a8f907804d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "15" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501389} {:answer/id #uuid "5bdee396-6d9f-5bbe-8378-a50d04de0635" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "24" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501392} {:answer/id #uuid "df2d382e-5a80-52bc-a649-14e4acf7e481" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3 \\sqrt{26}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501408} {:answer/id #uuid "fd3387cd-5801-5797-af72-00603e84116c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3 \\sqrt{23}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501413}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "df2d382e-5a80-52bc-a649-14e4acf7e481" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3 \\sqrt{26}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501408} :answer-field/id #uuid "b7666596-5028-5069-996f-ad5e72c1af9c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501402}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "ff8c4899-ff23-5168-90d9-e8d647d7f269" :question/problem "![](images/6b/6bd80d88ece15997923e5860ff1328dea542c2950c9e4399eba6a5e872070f18.png)\n\nLet $P(-6, 6)$ and $Q(9, 9)$. Find $|\\overrightarrow{PQ}|$." :question/requires-calculator false :question/worked-solution "We have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\overrightarrow{OP} &= p = - 6 i + 6 j, \\\\\n\\overrightarrow{OQ} &= q = 9 i + 9 j.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpressing $\\overrightarrow{PQ}$ as the difference of position vectors, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\overrightarrow{PQ} &= \\overrightarrow{OQ} - \\overrightarrow{OP} \\\\\n&= q - p \\\\\n&= (9 i + 9 j) - (- 6 i + 6 j) \\\\\n&= 15 i + 3 j\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the formula for the magnitude of a vector, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n|\\overrightarrow{PQ}| &= \\sqrt{(15)^{2} + (3)^{2}} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{225 + 9} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{234} \\\\\n&= 3 \\sqrt{26}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186501424 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "20917d48-ba12-5d1f-b21a-0ff1206db43b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{2 \\sqrt{85}}{85} \\\\ \\frac{9 \\sqrt{85}}{85}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501420} {:answer/id #uuid "4448f5e2-51c2-5573-af62-a5a77921a60f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{2 \\sqrt{85}}{85} \\\\ \\frac{3 \\sqrt{85}}{85}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501426} {:answer/id #uuid "69c38540-0ec4-5bc4-9f17-e6d71b15d3c2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501431} {:answer/id #uuid "6d3a56cd-220c-5797-bf5d-1232e4735202" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{2 \\sqrt{85}}{85} \\\\ - \\frac{9 \\sqrt{85}}{85}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501432} {:answer/id #uuid "bbfe8e76-81fa-5a5d-bd36-45854289df62" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\sqrt{85}}{85} \\\\ \\frac{9 \\sqrt{85}}{85}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501444}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "20917d48-ba12-5d1f-b21a-0ff1206db43b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{2 \\sqrt{85}}{85} \\\\ \\frac{9 \\sqrt{85}}{85}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501420} :answer-field/id #uuid "ca99c9f4-3bb7-5fbd-9bf4-f8cd3f0a0232" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501447}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "3fe77d7b-c249-5da3-ae37-3fb1cc69e4ca" :question/problem "Let $a=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}$ and $b=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 13\\end{bmatrix}$. Find a unit vector that is parallel to $2a+b$ and points the same direction." :question/requires-calculator false :question/worked-solution "Remember that to find a unit vector that is parallel to a given vector and points the same direction, we need to divide the given vector by its length:\n\n$$\nu=\\frac{2a+b}{|2a+b|}\n$$\n\nFirst, let's compute the sum:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n2a+b &= 2\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 13\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 13\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}0+(2) \\\\ (-4)+(13)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula for the magnitude of a vector, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n|2a+b| &= \\sqrt{(2)^2+(9)^2} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{85} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{85}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we divide $2a+b$ by its length and get the following unit vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nu &= \\frac{2a+b}{|2a+b|} \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{85}}\\cdot (2a+b) \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{85}}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{2 \\sqrt{85}}{85} \\\\ \\frac{9 \\sqrt{85}}{85}\\end{bmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186501425 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "36b5a9a2-dc90-5731-af84-a45f4751626a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{20}{29} \\\\ \\frac{21}{29}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501422} {:answer/id #uuid "5d3cacb0-979d-5cd5-8d2c-9ce9ba39d324" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{10}{29} \\\\ - \\frac{21}{29}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501429} {:answer/id #uuid "7d5bb797-4d29-566d-8a17-e90b3639c09b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}20 \\\\ -21\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186501434} {:answer/id #uuid "adcc82ff-26bb-5dc4-b727-5883ed507729" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{20}{29} \\\\ - \\frac{7}{29}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/re