 vector by its length:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u &= \\frac{b}{|b|}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula for the magnitude of a vector, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|b| &= \\sqrt{(-8)^2+(-6)^2} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{100} \\\\\n&= 10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we divide $b$ by its length and get the following unit vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u &= \\frac{b}{|b|} \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{10}\\cdot (b) \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{10}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-8 \\\\ -6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{4}{5} \\\\ - \\frac{3}{5}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186715839 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3adebc85-b3a1-5a8f-a093-736e749ae0de" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{4}{5} \\\\ \\frac{3}{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186715832} {:answer/id #uuid "4c3d9ad8-cccf-5864-be42-c330832c2a54" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{4}{5} \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186715836} {:answer/id #uuid "b75fab10-95b7-5e55-a36d-0f58285b02ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ \\frac{3}{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186715852} {:answer/id #uuid "bc75b554-f6db-5563-a7f6-6c67c0d575ce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{5} \\\\ \\frac{4}{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186715854} {:answer/id #uuid "f8adebb6-603a-528b-b3be-6d5fafecd496" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{4}{5} \\\\ - \\frac{3}{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186715863}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3adebc85-b3a1-5a8f-a093-736e749ae0de" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{4}{5} \\\\ \\frac{3}{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186715832} :answer-field/id #uuid "c54f31ab-9db8-5aaf-ae62-0b97e329779f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186715856}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "6ccf4eb7-e633-55f7-ad59-83d8177f0e1c" :question/problem "Let $a=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}$. Find a unit vector that is parallel to $a$ and points the same direction." :question/requires-calculator false :question/worked-solution "Remember that to find a unit vector that is parallel to a given vector, we need to divide the given vector by its length:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u &= \\frac{a}{|a|}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula for the magnitude of a vector, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|a| &= \\sqrt{(4)^2+(3)^2} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{25} \\\\\n&= 5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we divide $a$ by its length and get the following unit vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u &= \\frac{a}{|a|} \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{5}\\cdot (a) \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{4}{5} \\\\ \\frac{3}{5}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186715845 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "01b882be-94b5-53ce-ad35-f8dab116e369" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{4}{5} \\\\ - \\frac{3}{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186715830} {:answer/id #uuid "3d5ee376-0620-5d41-ab84-c336239ebb12" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{5} \\\\ - \\frac{4}{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186715834} {:answer/id #uuid "8c24302d-3528-5c6b-95b8-c565bf2ecad3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- \\fra